title: "WERR: Zero-Memory Procedural System-1 Decision Engine via Polynomial Escape Dynamics"
abstract: "Deterministic, zero-storage System-1 reflex decision engine synthesizing typed decisions (noul, choice, score) from 24-byte complex polynomial boundary seeds and ZMod 9 principal ideal invariants."
